[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_CAPITAL]
Investigate §YCapital and Southern Regions§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_CAPITAL_desc]
Although the consumption of foal’s breath is the highest in the Eastern Region, the capital and Southern Regions are the administrative centers — perhaps there are corrupt officials in the central region as well.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_CAPITAL]
调查§Y首都以及南部地区§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_CAPITAL_desc]
固然，稚马之息的消耗最多在东部地区，但首都以及南部地区才是行政的中心——也许在中央也有着被腐蚀的官员。
